; Botched! map resource
; id: laserworks-01
; name: Laser Works
; description: G2-B step 1: two continuous laser lanes across the middle, a safe gap between them.
; players: 2-4
;
; Emitters L> at (1,5) and L< at (10,5) fire every tick along row 5 until they reach the walls at (4,5)
; and (7,5): the lit tiles are (2,5), (3,5), (8,5) and (9,5). Each hit is +1 damage (three disable a robot,
; which drops its crate where it stands). The middle tiles (5,5) and (6,5) are never lit, so the
; north/south crossing is either a gamble through a lane or the safe, longer way through the gap.
; The lasers are neutral machinery: they award no points.
